<title>USA: Montana $16.7 mln bonds yield 5.55 pct in 2011.</title>
<headline>Montana $16.7 mln bonds yield 5.55 pct in 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said Monday it tentatively priced $16.7 million Montana Health Facilities bonds at a top yield of 5.55 percent in 2011.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>MONTANA HEALTH FACILITIES</p>
<p>RE: $16,730,000</p>
<p>DATED: 9/1/96</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 3/1/97</p>
<p>RATED AAA/AAA</p>
<p>CALLABLE: 9/1/06 AT 100</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>    9/1	     Amount	  Coupon	Price</p>
<p>    Maturity	(million)	   (pct)	 (% of par)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    1997	    $1.610	  3.85	  3.85</p>
<p>    1998	    $1.670	  4.25	  4.25</p>
